#describe what Delegates write .ai/tmp/guide.json and record it; verify --require-guide joins the delegate gate, the orchestrator gate and the e2e delegate checks.
#describe before A delegate PR could ship without a guide.
#describe after The protocol teaches a good guide, and the gates fail a record without one.
#describe verified Offline delegate run green with a guide and red with the no-guide fake; pnpm test and typecheck green (one load-timeout in install-skills passes alone).
#plan guided-pr-review s3.1
